              "fill": "$text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 600,
              "content": "Résumés are generated, portfolios are free to fabricate, take-homes are solved in ninety seconds. Paste the role you're aiming for, build toward it, and keep a record of evidence — checks passed, artefacts finished — that a hiring manager can trust.",
